Capture Machine makes GIFs with gifski 1.34.0 by Kornel Lesiński, https://gif.ski

gifski is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 or later (LICENSE, beside this file). GIF
Machine runs it as a separate program, gifski, inside the app's Helpers folder. Its source:
https://github.com/ImageOptim/gifski/tree/1.34.0 and https://crates.io/crates/gifski/1.34.0

It is built without FFmpeg: cargo install gifski --version 1.34.0 --no-default-features --features binary,gifsicle


The helper includes imagequant 4.4.1 (GPL-3.0-or-later), with code by Jef Poskanzer, Greg Roelofs and Kornel Lesiński.
Its full COPYRIGHT, including the original pngquant notice, is reproduced in THIRD-PARTY.txt with the other dependency licenses.
https://crates.io/crates/imagequant/4.4.1

Each Capture Machine release offers gifski-1.34.0-source.tar.gz alongside the disk image. It includes the corresponding
source, locked dependencies, licensing files and offline build instructions.
https://github.com/artisticmedic/capture-machine/releases/tag/v1.0.0
